            rdf:value "Phylogenetically diverse, predominantly microscopic free-living, symbiotic organisms capable of oxygenic photosynthesis. Traditionally, soil algae include photoautotrophic prokaryotes (cyanobacteria, blue-green algae) and photoautotrophic protists (eukaryotic algae). "@en ] ;
